stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Tmux
    lg1: Herdr
    lg2: Moving
    lg3: Breaks NoDeadlock or RecordMatchesProcesses
    lg4: Breaks NoDeadlock in some cases
    lg5: Path to the NoDeadlock or RecordMatchesProcesses bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 pink
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 mayBreak
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: On tmux, no Claude running (set to tmux)
  s1: On tmux, Claude running (set to tmux)
  s2: On tmux, no Claude running (set to Herdr)
  s3: On tmux, Claude running (set to Herdr)
  s4: Herdr launch sent, not bound yet
  s5: Herdr launch sent, not bound yet, old tmux Claude still runs
  s6: On Herdr, Claude running (set to Herdr)
  s7: On Herdr, Claude running (set to Herdr), old tmux Claude still runs
  s8: On Herdr, Claude running (set to tmux)
  s9: On Herdr, Claude running (set to tmux), old tmux Claude still runs
  s10: Herdr Claude ended, row not retired (set to tmux)
  s11: Row retired, move back unfinished (set to tmux)
  s12: Back on tmux, no Claude running (set to tmux)
  s13: Back on tmux, Claude running (set to tmux)
  [*] --> s0
  [*] --> s1
  s0 --> s2: the server restarts, maybe with the other host set
  s1 --> s3: the server restarts, maybe with the other host set
  s2 --> s0: the server restarts, maybe with the other host set
  s3 --> s3: you send a message
  s3 --> s1: the server restarts, maybe with the other host set
  s0 --> s1: tmux launches with --resume of the same session
  s2 --> s4: Herdr launches with --resume of the same session or Herdr launches a fresh session [no session to resume]
  s3 --> s2: the old tmux Claude gets /exit and ends
  s3 --> s5: Herdr launches a fresh session [no session to resume]
  s4 --> s6: the launch reports its start and binds the Herdr row
  s5 --> s7: the launch reports its start and binds the Herdr row
  s6 --> s8: the server restarts, maybe with the other host set
  s7 --> s9: the server restarts, maybe with the other host set
  s8 --> s10: the Herdr Claude gets /exit and ends
  s9 --> s9: you send a message
  s10 --> s11: the Herdr row is retired
  s11 --> s12: the host marker is set to tmux
  s12 --> s13: tmux launches with --resume of the same session
